- Affected code:
  - `package.json`
  - `Makefile`
  - `src/app.ts`
  - `src/styles.scss`
  - `ink.template.html` (or current HTML template source)
  - `build/inject.js`
  - `dist/` build outputs
  - `tests/qunit/` (new)
